flowchart TD
Runner["Test runner / scenario<br/>NUnit, Reqnroll, or console"]
UI["Browser channel<br/>Pages + components + waits<br/>User-visible behavior"]
API["API channel<br/>Generated client + pipeline<br/>Setup and verification"]
DB["Database channel<br/>Repository + EF context factory<br/>Eventual persisted state"]
App["Application under test<br/>Your new web application"]
Emulator["Upstream emulator<br/>WireMock or admin service<br/>Configured explicitly by your app"]
Evidence["Artifacts / integrations<br/>Local JSON, PNG, HTML, files<br/>Optional inbox / remote reporting"]
Runner --> UI
Runner --> API
Runner --> DB
UI --> App
API --> App
DB --> App
App -->|upstream| Emulator
App -->|outputs| Evidence
